    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλήνᾰφ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>idle talk, nonsense,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρόνοια δ᾽ ἡ θνητὴ καπνὸς καὶ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					482.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Kol.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
				35
			</span></i>, Amelius ap.<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Plot.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς θεοὺς ἡγεῖτο εἶναι φλήναφον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					803.4
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.267S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Somn.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pisc.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>babbler,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ φλήναφε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					109
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.119
			</span></i>.</div>
